<%@ page pageEncoding="UTF-8" %>
<%@ include file="common/head.jspf" %>
<div class="form-page"><div class="page-heading"><h1>${empty v.id?'新增图书':'编辑图书'}</h1><a class="button secondary" href="${ctx}/app?module=books">返回列表</a></div><div class="form-layout"><section class="panel form-panel"><div class="section-heading"><h2>馆藏资料</h2><span class="muted">* 为必填项</span></div><form autocomplete="off" method="post" action="${ctx}/app" class="record-form"><input type="hidden" name="module" value="books"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="save"><input type="hidden" name="id" value="<c:out value='${v.id}'/>"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="${sessionScope.csrf}">
<div class="field"><label for="bookNo">书号 <em>*</em></label><input spellcheck="false" id="bookNo" name="bookNo" value="<c:out value='${v.bookNo}'/>" required maxlength="40" pattern="[A-Za-z0-9_-]{1,40}" placeholder="如：BK-0001" ${not empty v.id?'readonly':''}><small class="field-error" id="bookNo-error"><c:out value="${errors.bookNo}"/></small><small>每册图书使用独立书号，保存后不可更改。</small></div><div class="field"><label for="bookTitle">书名 <em>*</em></label><input id="bookTitle" name="bookTitle" value="<c:out value='${v.bookTitle}'/>" required maxlength="200" placeholder="请输入完整书名"><small class="field-error" id="bookTitle-error"><c:out value="${errors.bookTitle}"/></small></div><div class="form-row"><div class="field"><label for="author">作者 <em>*</em></label><input id="author" name="author" value="<c:out value='${v.author}'/>" required maxlength="200"><small class="field-error" id="author-error"><c:out value="${errors.author}"/></small></div><div class="field"><label for="edition">版本号 <em>*</em></label><input id="edition" name="edition" value="<c:out value='${v.edition}'/>" required maxlength="80" placeholder="如：第3版"><small class="field-error" id="edition-error"><c:out value="${errors.edition}"/></small><small>版次不详时填写“版次未注明”。</small></div></div><c:choose><c:when test="${v.status=='BORROWED'}"><input type="hidden" name="status" value="BORROWED"><div class="inline-note"><span class="badge amber">在借</span> 这册书尚未归还，当前可修改书目资料，状态由借还登记维护。</div></c:when><c:when test="${not empty v.id}"><div class="field"><label for="status">馆藏状态</label><select id="status" name="status"><option value="AVAILABLE" ${v.status=='AVAILABLE'?'selected':''}>可借</option><option value="OFF_SHELF" ${v.status=='OFF_SHELF'?'selected':''}>已下架</option></select></div></c:when><c:otherwise></c:otherwise></c:choose><div class="form-actions"><a class="button secondary" href="${ctx}/app?module=books">取消</a><button class="button primary">保存图书资料</button></div></form></section></div>
</div>
<%@ include file="common/foot.jspf" %>
